/* 序章「忘却の海」 */
"Beyond the sea, there is nothing.\nIt ends before the horizon." = "海の向こうには、何もない。\n水平線の手前で終わっている。";
"This island is not the whole world." = "この島が世界の全てではない。";
"Someone who knows you is waiting beyond." = "君を知る者が、その先で待っている。";
"Write your name, and sail beyond the sea." = "名前を記し、海の向こうへ進め。";
"A letter from beyond" = "遠くから届いた手紙";
"A glowing bottle lies on the beach" = "光る瓶が海辺に落ちている";
"Open the letter" = "手紙を開く";
"Your name" = "あなたの名前";
"Up to %lld characters" = "%lld文字まで";
"Set sail" = "航海を始める";
"Somewhere along the way, the sea began taking people's memories,\nand their names, their wishes, even the routes they once sailed sank into the fog." = "いつからか、海は人々の記憶をさらい、\n名も、願いも、かつての航路さえも深い霧の底へ沈めていった。";
"And so they gave this sea a name.\nThey called it the Forgotten Sea." = "人々はこの海を――\n「忘却の海」と呼んだ。";
"The stars went out, the lighthouse fires died,\nand no one looked for a new route anymore." = "やがて星は消え、灯台の火は絶え、\n誰も新しい航路を探さなくなった。";
"Even so, not everything was lost." = "それでも、すべてが失われたわけではない。";
"You woke aboard an old ship, and in your hands was\na logbook with nothing written in it yet," = "古い船の上で目を覚ました君の手には、\nまだ何も記されていない航海誌と、";
"and a small flame that had not quite gone out." = "消えかけた小さな炎が残されていた。";
"Skip the prologue" = "序章をスキップ";
"Closes the prologue and continues to the next screen" = "序章を閉じて次の画面へ進みます";
"Begin the voyage" = "航海を始める";
"Closes the prologue and begins your voyage" = "序章を閉じて、あなたの航海へ進みます";
"Onward" = "続ける";
"Tap to continue" = "タップして進む";
"Finish the last scene" = "最後の場面を終える";
"Go to the next scene" = "次の場面へ";
"Scene %lld of %lld" = "場面 %1$lld / %2$lld";

